    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Clean this student enrolment row and return only a JSON object\n\nRow dta : {{ JSON.stringify( $json) }}\n\nRules \n-Name: Title Case (Manoj K)\n-Email: if invalid Email, set INVALID EMAIL\n-Phone: if less then 10 digits, set MISSING\n-Course: only Python or Machine Learning or Data Science\n-Fees_Paid: yes/YES= true, no/NO =false\n-City: Title Case, empty=UNKNOWN\n-Enrolled_Data: Convet to YYYY-MM-DD\n\nReturn only JSON, No Explanation , No Markdown",
